elds.io/gitter/room/ajv-validator/ajv.svg","line":9},{"title":"ajv v8","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv","line":11},{"title":"ajv-keywords v5.0.0","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv-keywords/releases/tag/v5.0.0","line":11},{"title":"ajv-keywords v3","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv-keywords/tree/v3","line":13},{"title":"ajv v6","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/tree/v6","line":13},{"title":"Install","target":"#install","line":17},{"title":"Usage","target":"#usage","line":18},{"title":"Keywords","target":"#keywords","line":19},{"title":"Types","target":"#types","line":20},{"title":"typeof","target":"#typeof","line":21},{"title":"instanceof","target":"#instanceof","line":22},{"title":"Keywords for numbers","target":"#keywords-for-numbers","line":23},{"title":"range and exclusiveRange","target":"#range-and-exclusiverange","line":24},{"title":"Keywords for strings","target":"#keywords-for-strings","line":25},{"title":"regexp","target":"#regexp","line":26},{"title":"transform","target":"#transform","line":27},{"title":"Keywords for arrays","target":"#keywords-for-arrays","line":28},{"title":"uniqueItemProperties","target":"#uniqueitemproperties","line":29},{"title":"Keywords for objects","target":"#keywords-for-objects","line":30},{"title":"allRequired","target":"#allrequired","line":31},{"title":"anyRequired","target":"#anyrequired","line":32},{"title":"oneRequired","target":"#onerequired","line":33},{"title":"patternRequired","target":"#patternrequired","line":34},{"title":"prohibited","target":"#prohibited","line":35},{"title":"deepProperties","target":"#deepproperties","line":36},{"title":"deepRequired","target":"#deeprequired","line":37},{"title":"dynamicDefaults","target":"#dynamicdefaults","line":38},{"title":"Keywords for all types","target":"#keywords-for-all-types","line":39},{"title":"select/selectCases/selectDefault","target":"#selectselectcasesselectdefault","line":40},{"title":"Security contact","target":"#security-contact","line":41},{"title":"Open-source software support","target":"#open-source-software-support","line":42},{"title":"License","target":"#license","line":43},{"title":"standalone validation code","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/standalone.md","line":46},{"title":"Ajv v7","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv","line":50},{"title":"`code` keyword","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/keywords.md#define-keyword-with-code-generation-function","line":149},{"title":"standalone validation code","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/standalone.md","line":149},{"title":"@blainesch","target":"https://github.com/blainesch","line":296},{"title":"`code` keyword","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/keywords.md#define-keyword-with-code-generation-function","line":298},{"title":"standalone validation code","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/standalone.md","line":298},{"title":"json-schema-org/json-schema-spec#203","target":"https://github.com/json-schema-org/json-schema-spec/issues/203#issue-197211916","line":505},{"title":"discriminator","target":"https://ajv.js.org/json-schema.html#discriminator","line":511},{"title":"\\$data reference","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/validation.md#data-reference","line":517},{"title":"\\$data reference","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/validation.md#data-reference","line":533},{"title":"default keyword treated by Ajv","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv#assigning-defaults","line":590},{"title":"0, 1) interval\n- `\"randomint\"` - pseudo-random integer number. If string is used as a property value, the function will randomly return 0 or 1. If object `{ func: 'randomint', args: { max: N } }` is used then the default will be an integer number in [0, N) interval.\n- `\"seq\"` - sequential integer number starting from 0. If string is used as a property value, the default sequence will be used. If object `{ func: 'seq', args: { name: 'foo'} }` is used then the sequence with name `\"foo\"` will be used. Sequences are global, even if different ajv instances are used.\n\n```javascript\nconst schema = {\n  type: \"object\",\n  dynamicDefaults: {\n    ts: \"datetime\",\n    r: {func: \"randomint\", args: {max: 100}},\n    id: {func: \"seq\", args: {name: \"id\"}},\n  },\n  properties: {\n    ts: {\n      type: \"string\",\n      format: \"date-time\",\n    },\n    r: {\n      type: \"integer\",\n      minimum: 0,\n      exclusiveMaximum: 100,\n    },\n    id: {\n      type: \"integer\",\n      minimum: 0,\n    },\n  },\n}\n\nconst data = {}\najv.validate(data) // true\ndata // { ts: '2016-12-01T22:07:28.829Z', r: 25, id: 0 }\n\nconst data1 = {}\najv.validate(data1) // true\ndata1 // { ts: '2016-12-01T22:07:29.832Z', r: 68, id: 1 }\n\najv.validate(data1) // true\ndata1 // didn't change, as all properties were defined\n```\n\nWhen using the `useDefaults` option value `\"empty\"`, properties and items equal to `null` or `\"\"` (empty string) will be considered missing and assigned defaults. Use `allOf` [compound keyword","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv/blob/master/KEYWORDS.md#compound-keywords","line":605},{"title":"standalone validation code","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/standalone.md","line":729},{"title":"Tidelift security contact","target":"https://tidelift.com/security","line":734},{"title":"Tidelift subscription","target":"https://tidelift.com/subscription/pkg/npm-ajv-keywords?utm_source=npm-ajv-keywords&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=readme","line":741},{"title":"MIT","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv-keywords/blob/master/LICENSE","line":745}],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[52,54],[60,67],[71,73],[77,79],[83,85],[89,91],[95,104],[120,124],[134,138],[142,147],[161,175],[187,205],[230,244],[248,263],[275,