` (empty string) will be considered missing and assigned defaults. Use `allOf` [compound keyword","target":"https://github.com/epoberezkin/ajv/blob/master/KEYWORDS.md#compound-keywords","line":20},{"title":"standalone validation code","target":"https://github.com/ajv-validator/ajv/blob/master/docs/standalone.md","line":144}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
